        dct:title "Simple chemical reaction systems with limit cycle behaviour" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ydbio.2018.10.005> dct:date "2018"^^xsd:gYear ;
        dct:title "Meristem development and activity in gametophytes of the model fern, Ceratopteris richardii" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1038/s42003-022-03627-y> dct:date "2022"^^xsd:gYear ;
        dct:title "Positional cues and cell division dynamics drive meristem development and archegonium formation in Ceratopteris gametophytes" .
